232
00:16:40,200 --> 00:16:41,000
Get out!

233
00:16:41,900 --> 00:16:42,700
Ouch!

234
00:16:43,533 --> 00:16:44,333
Get out!

235
00:16:52,566 --> 00:16:53,366
