259
00:19:14,400 --> 00:19:15,200
No.

260
00:19:17,266 --> 00:19:21,333
Or would you rather see me
in my pajamas?

261
00:19:32,933 --> 00:19:35,333
I don't want to see that.
I'm leaving.

262
00:19:38,066 --> 00:19:38,866
Well...

263
00:19:39,333 --> 00:19:41,200
And don't forget to
lock your door properly.

264
00:19:41,800 --> 00:19:42,600
Your phone.

265
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:43,733
