271
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,900
Stop asking so many questions.

272
00:20:21,766 --> 00:20:25,200
Oh, and go get me a coffee.

273
00:20:25,866 --> 00:20:27,133
Get one for yourself too.

274
00:20:28,733 --> 00:20:29,700
