278
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:03,800
It's not like I wanted to see it.

279
00:21:05,333 --> 00:21:06,133
Ow!

280
00:21:06,466 --> 00:21:08,266
Get a hold of yourself, Theerachat.

281
00:21:13,100 --> 00:21:14,300
She's ridiculously gorgeous.

282
00:21:20,933 --> 00:21:21,733
Ow!

283
