so I can blackmail you later.

284
00:21:39,266 --> 00:21:40,200
Damn it!

285
00:22:03,066 --> 00:22:03,866
Nant...

286
00:22:04,866 --> 00:22:05,666
Um...

287
00:22:05,900 --> 00:22:07,566
I don't mean to pry, but...

288
00:22:08,600 --> 00:22:11,133
I need you to give me the whole truth.

289
00:22:12,066 --> 00:22:14,966
So, did you and Boss actually...

290
00:22:18,700 --> 00:22:20,000
Did you two really kiss?

291
00:22:21,266 --> 00:22:22,666
What kiss?
Nothing happened!

292
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:24,933
I was sitting right there!

293
00:22:25,533 --> 00:22:27,200
You were way too drunk
to be a reliable witness.

294
00:22:27,666 --> 00:22:28,466
Just tell us.

295
00:22:28,466 --> 00:22:30,400
Yeah, you were completely wasted.

296
00:22:34,566 --> 00:22:35,400
Oh!

297
00:22:37,900 --> 00:22:40,566
I was really drunk last night.

298
00:22:41,366 --> 00:22:42,166
Uh...

299
00:22:42,500 --> 00:22:45,400
I blacked out.
I don't remember a thing.

300
00:22:46,666 --> 00:22:48,066
Hanna doesn't remember either.

301
00:22:48,733 --> 00:22:49,966
Nant doesn't remember.

302
00:22:51,733 --> 00:22:53,933
Maybe nothing actually happened?

303
00:22:55,566 --> 00:22:56,866
Maybe that's true.

304
00:22:57,400 --> 00:22:58,500
Because someone like Boss...

305
00:22:58,700 --> 00:22:59,966
She's too lazy to even smile.

306
00:23:00,066 --> 00:23:01,166
So I doubt she'd actually kiss someone.

307
00:23:07,733 --> 00:23:08,566
What are you talking about?

308
00:23:09,028 --> 00:23:10,800
I could hear you all the way
from the elevator.

309
00:23:11,600 --> 00:23:13,800
Nothing, Boss.
Absolutely nothing.

310
00:23:15,066 --> 00:23:17,166
Then get back to work.

311
00:23:18,366 --> 00:23:19,166
Okay, okay.

312
00:23:38,400 --> 00:23:39,600
Do you really not remember?

313
00:23:42,966 --> 00:23:45,200
Last night,
you said you wanted to kiss me.

314
00:23:46,066 --> 00:23:47,700
But now you suddenly don't remember?

315
00:23:53,466 --> 00:23:54,556
How cruel.

316
00:23:55,422 --> 00:23:56,300
Thitinant.

317
00:24:04,500 --> 00:24:05,300
Whoa!

318
00:24:06,100 --> 00:24:07,166
I thought she was going to kiss me.

319
00:24:30,866 --> 00:24:32,400
You've got a lot of mosquito bites.

320
00:24:33,533 --> 00:24:35,333
Who were you keeping
watch over last night?

321
00:24:36,700 --> 00:24:37,500
Keeping watch?

322
00:24:38,000 --> 00:24:38,800
Who was keeping watch?

323
00:24:39,700 --> 00:24:41,666
You think someone like me would
actually stay up watching over you?

324
00:24:43,066 --> 00:24:43,866
What?

325
00:24:44,700 --> 00:24:46,800
I never said you were watching over me.

326
00:24:47,700 --> 00:24:48,733
You're awfully defensive, Boss.

327
00:24:55,266 --> 00:24:56,566
I'm jealous of those mosquitoes.

328
00:24:58,700 --> 00:25:00,200
They even got to bite your neck.

329
00:25:03,200 --> 00:25:05,666
You've been bitting
at me nonstop yourself.

330
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:06,626
You...

331
00:25:06,626 --> 00:25:08,733
You're even worse than a mosquito.

332
00:25:11,133 --> 00:25:12,066
Me?

333
00:25:13,366 --> 00:25:14,166
Mm-hmm.

334
00:25:15,300 --> 00:25:16,100
You are.

335
00:25:17,000 --> 00:25:17,800
Oh!

336
00:25:17,966 --> 00:25:19,000
Hey! Uh...

337
00:25:19,500 --> 00:25:20,300
Does it hurt?

338
00:25:20,733 --> 00:25:21,700
Sorry, sorry.

339
00:25:22,333 --> 00:25:23,133
Let me see.

340
00:25:23,733 --> 00:25:24,533
Where does it hurt?

341
00:25:26,066 --> 00:25:28,066
Boss, the client
requested some revisions...

342
00:25:28,366 --> 00:25:28,898
Ouch!

343
00:25:30,283 --> 00:25:31,667
Is this the work you've done?

344
00:25:31,667 --> 00:25:32,536
This is so sloppy!

345
00:25:32,536 --> 00:25:35,500
Didn't I tell you to check everything

346
00:25:35,500 --> 00:25:37,866
before it gets to me?
Do you want to get fired?

347
00:25:38,233 --> 00:25:39,540
Wait, wait!

348
00:25:40,766 --> 00:25:41,566
Boss.

349
00:25:42,133 --> 00:25:43,166
Please calm down.

350
00:25:43,600 --> 00:25:44,500
Secretary Han!

351
00:25:44,766 --> 00:25:45,266
Yes?

352
00:25:45,266 --> 00:25:45,766
Get out!

353
00:25:46,066 --> 00:25:48,733
And don't enter my office
without permission.

354
00:25:49,366 --> 00:25:49,866
Whoa!

355
00:25:49,866 --> 00:25:50,366
Hey!

356
00:25:50,900 --> 00:25:52,133
Uh, yes, Boss.

357
00:25:53,700 --> 00:25:54,887
Are you asking for trouble?

358
00:25:54,887 --> 00:25:55,469
Oh!

359
00:25:55,469 --> 00:25:55,969
Get out!

360
00:25:55,969 --> 00:25:56,566
Yes, Boss.

361
00:25:56,766 --> 00:25:57,600
Please calm down!

362
00:26:14,166 --> 00:26:14,966
Ouch!

363
00:26:18,300 --> 00:26:18,800
Uh...

364
00:26:19,493 --> 00:26:23,733
I think...
I think my skirt just ripped.

365
00:26:23,866 --> 00:26:25,450
Oh, uh...

366
00:26:25,450 --> 00:26:28,900
Wait, wait.
Sit down first. Don't move.

367
00:26:39,766 --> 00:26:41,799
I happen to have
a spare in the cabinet.

368
00:26:41,799 --> 00:26:44,964
It might be a little loose on you
since it's my size, but...

369
00:26:45,368 --> 00:26:47,137
You can wear it for now.

370
00:26:48,200 --> 00:26:49,500
Thank you.

371
00:26:50,800 --> 00:26:52,266
Change in here.

372
00:26:52,666 --> 00:26:53,966
I'll wait outside.

373
00:26:55,566 --> 00:26:56,366
Hey!

374
00:26:58,333 --> 00:27:00,933
You're really going
to leave me like this, Boss?

375
00:27:02,133 --> 00:27:04,266
You haven't even checked

376
00:27:06,400 --> 00:27:08,133
whether it actually fits me.

377
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:15,333
Just put it on.
It's better than the ripped one.

378
00:27:31,900 --> 00:27:33,600
I'm about to put on the skirt now.

379
00:27:57,733 --> 00:27:59,266
I'm pulling it up now.

380
00:28:16,041 --> 00:28:18,041
I'm about to take the old one off.

381
00:28:24,133 --> 00:28:26,600
Boss, could you unzip
my old skirt for me?

382
00:28:46,566 --> 00:28:48,200
I've already unzipped your skirt.

383
00:28:53,166 --> 00:28:55,500
I'm slowly taking it off now.

384
00:28:59,200 --> 00:29:00,000
You can take it off.

385
00:29:26,333 --> 00:29:30,733
Thank you, Ms. Chat,
for taking my skirt off for me.

386
00:29:50,500 --> 00:29:51,300
Sorry.

387
00:30:01,733 --> 00:30:03,300
Do you like me yet, Boss?

388
00:30:09,600 --> 00:30:10,400
Uh...

389
00:30:10,966 --> 00:30:12,100
Who would ever like you?

390
00:30:41,100 --> 00:30:42,533
You really don't like me?

391
00:31:25,700 --> 00:31:26,500
Uh...

392
00:31:28,100 --> 00:31:28,900
I...

393
00:31:31,133 --> 00:31:32,533
I...

394
00:31:33,166 --> 00:31:34,533
Uh, I...

395
00:32:07,466 --> 00:32:09,133
I'm... I'm done putting on the skirt.

396
00:32:09,966 --> 00:32:11,400
I'll head outside now.

397
00:32:14,700 --> 00:32:15,500
Wait.

398
00:32:17,700 --> 00:32:18,500
Uh...

399
00:32:18,800 --> 00:32:19,966
Your old skirt...

400
00:32:20,366 --> 00:32:22,300
If you're not wearing it anymore,
don't leave it in my office.

401
00:32:22,500 --> 00:32:24,066
Someone might find it
and get the wrong idea.

402
00:32:25,166 --> 00:32:26,400
Uh, yeah, yeah.

403
00:32:27,066 --> 00:32:27,866
Keep it with you.

404
00:32:28,133 --> 00:32:29,366
Okay, uh...

405
00:32:29,700 --> 00:32:30,500
Thank you.

406
00:32:45,866 --> 00:32:47,466
I've already unzipped your skirt.

407
00:33:12,666 --> 00:33:13,812
Uh...

408
00:33:14,909 --> 00:33:16,424
Nant, is something wrong?

409
00:33:17,002 --> 00:33:19,484
Why is your face so red?

410
00:33:20,234 --> 00:33:22,866
Did Boss really hit you?

411
00:33:24,333 --> 00:33:25,133
Uh...

412
00:33:25,533 --> 00:33:26,333
I...

413
00:33:26,466 --> 00:33:27,600
I... I'm fine.

414
00:33:28,200 --> 00:33:29,400
How could you be fine?

415
00:33:30,300 --> 00:33:32,066
Look at your cheeks!
Goodness!

416
00:33:32,300 --> 00:33:33,100
Oh, Nant...

417
00:33:33,500 --> 00:33:34,900
You look like a total mess

418
00:33:35,766 --> 00:33:36,566
Nant...

419
00:33:38,400 --> 00:33:40,100
Boss didn't hit me!

420
00:33:41,000 --> 00:33:43,266
Boss didn't do anything rough to me.

421
00:33:44,166 --> 00:33:45,766
Your face is really red, though.

422
00:33:46,000 --> 00:33:47,200
Don't you have work to do?

423
00:33:49,300 --> 00:33:51,366
The company pays you to work,

424
00:33:52,266 --> 00:33:53,700
not to sit around gossiping.

425
00:33:54,866 --> 00:33:56,366
Oh! It's upside down.

426
00:33:57,333 --> 00:33:58,466
Som, wait...

427
00:34:00,000 --> 00:34:02,011
Sure, just like that.

428
00:34:02,011 --> 00:34:02,566
Oh, okay.

429
00:34:14,466 --> 00:34:15,500
Ms. Chat?

430
00:34:16,666 --> 00:34:18,166
Are you feeling alright?

431
00:34:18,566 --> 00:34:20,766
Why is your face so red?

432
00:34:23,066 --> 00:34:25,400
Secretary Han, get back to work.

433
00:34:45,300 --> 00:34:49,200
Do you think Boss is scarier
than usual today?

434
00:34:49,400 --> 00:34:51,133
Totally. I'm never
inviting her out again.

435
00:34:51,600 --> 00:34:52,866
Yeah, she's terrifying.

436
00:35:00,600 --> 00:35:01,597
Wait a minute.

437
00:35:02,290 --> 00:35:03,958
Let me get my thoughts straight.

438
00:35:03,958 --> 00:35:06,935
So, you kissed an intern...

439
00:35:06,935 --> 00:35:11,400
And that intern is the same girl
who ruined your wedding?

440
00:35:14,200 --> 00:35:16,000
Well, she was the one
who came onto me first.

441
00:35:17,800 --> 00:35:19,053
That's not even the point!

442
00:35:19,053 --> 00:35:22,133
The point is, you kissed her back, Chat!

443
00:35:23,100 --> 00:35:27,335
Right? Normally, if a hot, built guy
takes his shirt off to tease you...

444
00:35:27,335 --> 00:35:29,066
you don't even bat an eye.

445
00:35:29,533 --> 00:35:31,105
But this time, one little intern

446
00:35:31,105 --> 00:35:33,000
has you completely flustered?

447
00:35:33,533 --> 00:35:35,800
I told you, I didn't mean to!

448
00:35:37,700 --> 00:35:38,766
It just happened in the moment.

449
00:35:39,600 --> 00:35:40,766
It was self-defense.

450
00:35:41,300 --> 00:35:43,266
Right. Self-defense.

451
00:35:44,533 --> 00:35:46,766
You defended yourself by kissing her?

452
00:35:48,333 --> 00:35:49,133
Oh, come on!

453
00:35:49,400 --> 00:35:50,800
Can you stop pushing my buttons?

454
00:35:51,300 --> 00:35:52,400
I'm confused myself.

455
00:35:54,900 --> 00:35:55,966
Can I ask you something straight up?

456
00:35:56,533 --> 00:35:57,566
How do you feel about her?

457
00:36:01,566 --> 00:36:04,200
It wasn't bad.

458
00:36:07,566 --> 00:36:12,166
I mean...
It's not like I felt anything special.

459
00:36:13,466 --> 00:36:16,037
Oh, okay.
I got it.

460
00:36:16,037 --> 00:36:17,966
I get it now.

461
00:36:18,533 --> 00:36:19,400
Get what?

462
00:36:20,533 --> 00:36:21,575
Nothing.

463
00:36:21,575 --> 00:36:24,182
But I can barely remember
what she looks like now.

464
00:36:24,182 --> 00:36:25,366
Got a picture?
Let me see.

465
00:36:26,500 --> 00:36:27,600
Why do you want to see it?

466
00:36:28,266 --> 00:36:29,066
I'm not showing you.

467
00:36:29,333 --> 00:36:30,133
Wait a minute.

468
00:36:30,466 --> 00:36:32,000
You're being awfully protective.

469
00:36:33,400 --> 00:36:36,366
Don't tell me you like that girl.

470
00:36:36,766 --> 00:36:37,665
Are you crazy?

471
00:36:38,646 --> 00:36:39,566
I don't like her!

472
00:36:40,366 --> 00:36:43,466
The quicker you deny it,
the more suspicious you look.

473
00:36:44,333 --> 00:36:47,700
Honestly, your taste
has definitely changed.

474
00:36:48,933 --> 00:36:49,733
How so?

475
00:36:53,166 --> 00:36:54,766
You know, like shifting
your type to someone like her.

476
00:36:56,366 --> 00:36:57,166
Huh?

477
00:36:58,366 --> 00:36:59,466
No, no, no.

478
00:37:00,066 --> 00:37:00,866
That's not true.

479
00:37:01,866 --> 00:37:02,733
I don't like her.

480
00:37:03,500 --> 00:37:06,700
Do you really not like her,
or do you just not know how you feel?

481
00:37:14,200 --> 00:37:15,466
So what am I supposed to do?

482
00:37:16,166 --> 00:37:16,891
Easy.

483
00:37:17,411 --> 00:37:19,113
Try kissing another woman.

484
00:37:19,113 --> 00:37:21,602
If you feel the same spark
when you kiss her,

485
00:37:21,602 --> 00:37:23,548
then you just like women in general.

486
00:37:23,548 --> 00:37:24,866
That girl isn't anything special.

487
00:37:36,466 --> 00:37:40,100
Fine. I'll try it.
Let's get this over with.

488
00:37:45,100 --> 00:37:45,900
Excuse me!

489
00:37:52,066 --> 00:37:53,822
I've got someone for you.

490
00:37:53,822 --> 00:37:57,161
She's got exactly the same vibe,
though maybe a different feel.

491
00:37:57,161 --> 00:37:58,597
And if she's not your type,

492
00:37:58,597 --> 00:38:02,123
there are plenty more over there.
Give them a try!

493
00:38:02,123 --> 00:38:03,173
Let's settle this once and for all.

494
00:38:04,212 --> 00:38:06,766
Have a seat right here.

495
00:38:11,166 --> 00:38:12,768
Tonight, let me

496
00:38:12,768 --> 00:38:14,320
take care of you, Boss.

497
00:38:14,955 --> 00:38:18,935
I promise you won't feel lonely.

498
00:38:33,266 --> 00:38:34,766
Am I not taking
good enough care of you?

499
00:38:36,900 --> 00:38:38,336
Then...

500
00:38:39,202 --> 00:38:42,400
Let me make you feel even better.

501
00:38:47,700 --> 00:38:49,366
I'm about to put on the skirt now.

502
00:38:58,000 --> 00:39:01,366
Ms. Chat, you smell so nice.

503
00:39:04,166 --> 00:39:07,166
Do you know, Boss?
You smell so nice.

504
00:39:10,600 --> 00:39:11,566
Ms. Chat...

505
00:39:13,266 --> 00:39:14,466
I really like you.

506
00:39:15,500 --> 00:39:16,533
I want you to come back again.

507
00:39:18,066 --> 00:39:18,866
Would you?

508
00:39:20,800 --> 00:39:21,600
Please?

509
00:39:23,900 --> 00:39:25,466
Do you like me yet, Boss?

510
00:39:33,566 --> 00:39:34,366
No.

511
00:39:38,000 --> 00:39:40,266
I'm sorry,
but I'm not okay with this.

512
00:39:41,966 --> 00:39:43,002
Wait, Chat.

513
00:39:43,002 --> 00:39:44,684
If she's not the one, that's okay.

514
00:39:44,684 --> 00:39:46,500
I'll find someone else for you.

515
00:39:48,500 --> 00:39:49,300
Forget it.

516
00:39:50,766 --> 00:39:53,800
Hey, wait!
Where are you going, Chat?

517
00:39:59,300 --> 00:40:00,421
She's got it bad.

518
00:40:00,710 --> 00:40:02,708
Really bad.

519
00:40:02,708 --> 00:40:03,626
But...

520
00:40:04,838 --> 00:40:09,053
I think we should start
looking for wedding dresses.

521
00:40:09,573 --> 00:40:11,005
One hundred percent.

522
00:40:29,455 --> 00:40:30,600
What the hell is wrong with you,
Theerachat?

523
00:40:31,235 --> 00:40:32,911
Why did I drive all the way here?

524
00:40:56,566 --> 00:40:57,700
Secretary Han.

525
00:40:58,400 --> 00:41:01,666
Reschedule the vineyard meeting
for tomorrow.

526
00:41:02,866 --> 00:41:05,200
Check with Mr. Warayut first
to see if he's available.

527
00:41:06,659 --> 00:41:08,659
(Reschedule the vineyard meeting
for tomorrow.)

528
00:41:08,659 --> 00:41:10,659
(Check with Mr. Warayut first
to see if he's available.)

529
00:41:14,366 --> 00:41:21,366
Vineyard tomorrow.
Be outside your dorm at 6 AM sharp.

530
00:41:21,879 --> 00:41:24,514
Don't be late.

531
00:41:27,421 --> 00:41:28,671
Hmm...

532
00:41:32,166 --> 00:41:33,900
I wonder if that girl's complaining
about me already.

533
00:41:38,061 --> 00:41:39,080
Whatever.

534
00:41:40,001 --> 00:41:44,599
Out-of-town trip tomorrow, 2 nights.
6 AM sharp outside your building.

535
00:42:09,966 --> 00:42:11,400
It's 9:30 already.

536
00:42:33,533 --> 00:42:36,047
You said 6 AM.
No delays, no being late.

537
00:42:36,047 --> 00:42:38,466
But it's already 9:30, Boss.

538
00:42:41,066 --> 00:42:43,033
Are you doing this on purpose
just to mess with me?

539
00:42:43,033 --> 00:42:44,933
Leave me standing out here
in the burning sun like this?

540
00:42:47,466 --> 00:42:48,604
I'm your boss,

541
00:42:48,604 --> 00:42:51,235
and you're just my subordinate.

542
00:42:51,235 --> 00:42:54,455
My schedule is flexible.

543
00:42:54,455 --> 00:42:58,566
Your job is to wait.

544
00:43:02,200 --> 00:43:03,000
You're so mean.

545
00:43:09,600 --> 00:43:10,666
I bought this for you.

546
00:43:16,066 --> 00:43:16,866
Here, take it.

547
00:43:18,933 --> 00:43:20,423
Boss, you didn't...

548
00:43:20,423 --> 00:43:23,100
secretly slip laxatives
or poison in this, did you?

549
00:43:26,166 --> 00:43:27,272
What's wrong with you?

550
00:43:27,561 --> 00:43:30,166
Do you really think I'm that crazy?

551
00:43:30,500 --> 00:43:31,260
Yes.

552
00:43:32,010 --> 00:43:35,666
Because someone like you
is absolutely impossible to trust.

553
00:43:44,711 --> 00:43:46,018
But...

554
00:43:46,933 --> 00:43:47,943
Still...

555
00:43:48,867 --> 00:43:51,053
Th...Thank you.

556
00:44:14,866 --> 00:44:17,500
Hey, let me ask you something.

557
00:44:20,800 --> 00:44:23,466
If I were a cup of coffee,

558
00:44:24,166 --> 00:44:25,533
what kind would I be?

559
00:44:28,966 --> 00:44:31,266
Don't try to make small talk
to change the subject, Boss.

