01:02:15,933 --> 01:02:16,733
Ouch!

835
01:02:17,533 --> 01:02:18,333
Nant!

836
01:02:19,533 --> 01:02:20,333
What's wrong?

837
01:02:24,400 --> 01:02:25,200
Nant, are you okay?

838
01:02:25,300 --> 01:02:26,466
Ouch! How did you get in here?

839
01:02:27,266 --> 01:02:28,066
Uh...

840
01:02:28,700 --> 01:02:31,152
You went quiet, so

841
01:02:32,653 --> 01:02:33,933
I came to check on you.

842
01:02:34,766 --> 01:02:35,878
Just checking on me?

843
01:02:36,859 --> 01:02:38,500
Or were you sneaking a peek?

844
01:02:41,933 --> 01:02:44,400
Are you crazy?
Who was sneaking a peek?

845
01:02:48,066 --> 01:02:49,158
I was just...

846
01:02:49,735 --> 01:02:51,100
worried about you.

847
01:03:01,000 --> 01:03:03,800
Can you even manage to shower now?

848
01:03:05,000 --> 01:03:05,800
Yes.

849
01:03:06,600 --> 01:03:07,733
Then why did you scream?

850
01:03:08,466 --> 01:03:09,266
Are you drunk?

851
01:03:12,466 --> 01:03:13,266
No.

852
01:03:15,766 --> 01:03:17,333
But do you want to know

853
01:03:18,333 --> 01:03:20,166
why I screamed?

854
01:03:30,966 --> 01:03:31,766
I don't want to know.

855
01:03:33,466 --> 01:03:34,466
Go take your shower.

856
01:03:35,266 --> 01:03:36,066
You little pervert.

857
01:03:49,933 --> 01:03:51,400
Damn it, Theerachat.

858
01:03:52,400 --> 01:03:54,666
Why did I keep staring
at that girl for so long?

859
01:04:41,166 --> 01:04:42,766
You don't have to sneak
a peek this time.

860
01:04:44,850 --> 01:04:46,850
You can look directly.

861
01:04:50,366 --> 01:04:51,375
Are you crazy?

862
01:04:52,125 --> 01:04:53,200
Who's sneaking a peek?

863
01:04:54,932 --> 01:04:57,083
I was just worried about you.

864
01:05:02,200 --> 01:05:03,366
What about now?

865
01:05:04,900 --> 01:05:05,900
Do you want to look?

866
01:05:13,166 --> 01:05:13,966
No.

867
01:05:14,500 --> 01:05:15,866
There's nothing worth looking at.

868
01:06:03,222 --> 01:06:05,222
Look who's playing hard to get.

869
01:06:08,400 --> 01:06:09,733
Want to take another look?

870
01:06:11,500 --> 01:06:12,366
You might change your mind.

871
01:06:18,900 --> 01:06:19,700
No.

872
01:06:20,266 --> 01:06:21,600
There's nothing worth looking at.

873
01:06:43,566 --> 01:06:44,466
What are you doing?

874
01:06:47,466 --> 01:06:48,566
Just proving something.

875
01:06:49,766 --> 01:06:51,566
Whether you really meant

876
01:06:53,466 --> 01:06:54,566
what you said earlier.

877
01:07:04,333 --> 01:07:05,600
I'm your boss.

878
01:07:06,533 --> 01:07:07,800
When I tell you to stop, you stop.

879
01:07:08,500 --> 01:07:10,333
But we're not at the office, are we?

880
01:07:13,283 --> 01:07:15,283
It's just the two of us here.

881
01:07:20,400 --> 01:07:22,166
Can I just call you Chat?

882
01:07:51,110 --> 01:07:52,071
How does that feel?

883
01:07:53,482 --> 01:07:54,732
Do you like it?

884
01:07:59,733 --> 01:08:00,533
I do.

885
01:08:07,733 --> 01:08:10,000
What are you doing, Nant?

886
01:08:13,966 --> 01:08:15,800
I thought you said you didn't like me.

887
01:08:18,133 --> 01:08:19,086
Or...

888
01:08:20,818 --> 01:08:22,900
Are you just
too turned on to remember?

889
01:08:30,766 --> 01:08:32,466
Can you kiss me, Chat?

890
01:08:35,333 --> 01:08:36,466
You're quite the smooth talker.

891
01:08:39,333 --> 01:08:41,300
So where do you want me to kiss you?

892
01:08:44,200 --> 01:08:45,000
Your upper lip...

893
01:08:49,577 --> 01:08:51,028
or...

894
01:08:52,020 --> 01:08:53,558
your lower lip?

895
01:09:28,866 --> 01:09:30,133
You're pretty aggressive, aren't you?

896
01:09:32,400 --> 01:09:33,333
Want to keep going?

897
01:09:39,700 --> 01:09:41,466
If you don't know
what you're doing, Chat.

898
01:09:43,366 --> 01:09:44,766
I can teach you.

899
01:09:46,266 --> 01:09:47,066
For free, too.

900
01:09:52,166 --> 01:09:53,600
You're that confident?

901
01:09:56,733 --> 01:09:59,066
Well, I know a little more than you do.

902
01:10:01,200 --> 01:10:03,000
You think I'm that inexperienced?

903
01:10:05,500 --> 01:10:06,800
We'll see just
how inexperienced you are.

904
01:10:12,224 --> 01:10:15,919
Theerachat, if this goes any further,
you're going to lose control.

905
01:10:22,366 --> 01:10:23,266
I smell sweaty.

906
01:10:24,533 --> 01:10:25,566
I'm going to shower first.

907
01:10:27,200 --> 01:10:28,333
I don't mind.

908
01:10:34,933 --> 01:10:35,933
But I do.

909
01:11:02,900 --> 01:11:05,216
Damn it, Theerachat.

910
01:11:06,486 --> 01:11:07,966
Get a hold of yourself.

911
01:11:35,933 --> 01:11:36,733
Are you asleep?

912
01:11:45,666 --> 01:11:46,466
Seriously?

913
01:11:48,000 --> 01:11:50,333
You just left me worked up like this.

914
01:11:53,733 --> 01:11:56,300
I'll get you for this,
you little brat.

915
01:12:11,000 --> 01:12:13,800
Even when you're asleep,
you still manage to drive me crazy.

916
01:12:17,300 --> 01:12:19,026
Don't tell me you're asleep now

917
01:12:19,026 --> 01:12:21,766
and wake up hyper at night,
count me out.

918
01:12:41,266 --> 01:12:43,856
Sweet dreams, naughty girl.

919
01:13:20,900 --> 01:13:22,566
Where's Nant?

920
01:13:23,333 --> 01:13:25,372
You were okay just now, right?

921
01:13:25,372 --> 01:13:27,366
It's something I
has to take responsibility for anyway.

922
01:13:27,566 --> 01:13:29,302
Is there something more
between you and Nant.

923
01:13:29,302 --> 01:13:31,366
than just a boss and a subordinate?

924
01:13:31,766 --> 01:13:32,566
Hello.

925
01:13:33,066 --> 01:13:35,466
You suddenly brought me to this house.

926
01:13:36,700 --> 01:13:38,538
What's your plan exactly?

927
01:13:38,538 --> 01:13:42,333
Your eyes give you away. It's obvious
you're hiding something from me.

928
01:13:42,933 --> 01:13:44,097
What if one day...

929
01:13:44,097 --> 01:13:46,147
I really does something wrong?

930
01:13:46,396 --> 01:13:47,981
Will you be angry with me, Boss?
